        intro: "Body recomposition — losing fat while building or preserving lean mass — requires addressing three simultaneous physiological levers: GH-axis-driven visceral fat mobilization, selective anabolic GH pulsing without cortisol co-stimulation, and connective tissue resilience to sustain the training volume that preserves lean mass. Tesamorelin, Ipamorelin, and BPC-157 each address one of these levers in a mechanistically coherent stack.",
