        metaDescription: "Research guide to Epitalon, GHK-Cu, SS-31, and MOTS-c for longevity and cellular anti-aging. Telomere, epigenetic, mitochondrial, and metabolic mechanisms reviewed with honest evidence framing at PEPTIDEX.",
        intro: "Epitalon is the most-studied peptide for telomere-targeted longevity research — a synthetic tetrapeptide shown to reactivate telomerase in human somatic cells in vitro. No peptide on PEPTIDEX has demonstrated human lifespan extension in a clinical trial. This page covers four peptides targeting four distinct hallmarks of cellular aging, with explicit evidence boundaries for each.",
