        metaDescription: "Research guide to Kisspeptin, CJC-1295, Ipamorelin, and Tesamorelin for hormonal optimization. HPG axis stimulation, GH secretagogues, and FDA-approved GHRH analogs reviewed with honest evidence framing at PEPTIDEX.",
        intro: "Kisspeptin-10 is the most upstream hormonal optimization peptide on PEPTIDEX — the hypothalamic neuropeptide that activates the entire GnRH/LH/testosterone axis at its regulatory origin. CJC-1295 + Ipamorelin target the GH axis through complementary GHRH and ghrelin receptor pathways, with Tesamorelin as the FDA-approved GHRH analog benchmark. Upstream stimulation, not downstream replacement.",
